List every vendor request key, as on HyperOS

The camera's capabilities take every vendor tag of the camera on HyperOS, and elsewhere only the
request keys the HAL advertises, which leave out xiaomi.snapshot.imageName. Without it the
capture request carries no picture name, the final image cannot be matched to its capture and
only the quick view is saved. The HyperOS branch is taken here instead of setting the HyperOS
version properties, which other apps read to detect HyperOS.

--- a/Z5/c.smali
+++ b/Z5/c.smali
@@ -1952,7 +1952,7 @@
 
     invoke-static {}, LA/Q2;->j()Z
 
-    move-result p2
+    const/4 p2, 0x1
 
     if-eqz p2, :cond_34f
 
